# sent_id = life_phib-life_phib_02_s0016
# text_en = When I heard these things, I was very amazed, and said to him, “My father, if this is how it pleases the Lord, let us act thusly. Let us follow the Lord, and keep his commandments. All laborings for the Lord are good. They are honorable and greatly favored, and they enter the Lord's house together.
